Copyright (c) GrowthBook, Inc., licensed under the MIT License. The MIT notice is
reproduced in LICENSE at the repository root. Each ported function names its
source module in its doc comment.

Pinned upstream: growthbook/growthbook@0553a68def700abbcaaca8f5096da913f197804c

Upstream paths ported:
- packages/stats/gbstats/models/statistics.py
- packages/stats/gbstats/models/tests.py
- packages/stats/gbstats/frequentist/tests.py
- packages/stats/gbstats/bayesian/tests.py
- packages/stats/gbstats/utils.py
- packages/stats/gbstats/power/midexperimentpower.py
- packages/stats/gbstats/messages.py
- packages/sdk-js/src/util.ts
- packages/shared/src/power/power.ts

Statistical fixtures come from gbstats under CPython 3.12 with the upstream
hash-pinned requirements (scripts/gbstats-parity/requirements.lock). Assignment
fixtures use the upstream SDK cases and util.ts; pre-experiment power fixtures
use the upstream power.ts.

Code under packages/*/enterprise is not used.
